14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at the capital ledger balances to see what is real.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I am also curious about the two pilots from eight years ago.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
