35,2,1,talk,May,,"The ferry trial worked, but the data terms were never agreed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The late-turn pool is empty. Overtime is covering everything.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The mid-city route is slower, but the platforms clear fine.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The pre-war shells are hiding voids. Bidders are pricing for chaos.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The capital ledger is ring-fenced. The operating subsidy is gone.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, so the ferry and rail back offices are still misaligned?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, if the platforms clear, why do people complain about crowding?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"Because the waiting time for connections is the real killer, not the platform.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"Yes, May. The minutes confirm they never agreed on data terms.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, if the crews are thin, how do we staff a night extension?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"The late-evening pilot met its cost target, though.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,But the roster books show no spare capacity for it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The journey audits say most minutes are lost in waiting, not paying.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The accessibility programme had mixed results. Some lifts stalled.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The ticketing fees are higher than the paving budget. That is absurd.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"So the fare platform is technically possible, but the data is broken.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,The night service is a fantasy without new hires.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,The bus corridor might help the mid-city speed issue.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,The station upgrades are risky due to the pre-war structures.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,We have no money for a big capital project.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
